Package: RAssistant
Title: A Lightweight AI Assistant for RStudio
Version: 0.10.0
Authors@R: person("MySimpleSmart", role = c("aut", "cre"),
    email = "120612480+MySimpleSmart@users.noreply.github.com")
Description: Opens the existing Source-aware chat assistant in the RStudio
    Viewer. Supports image uploads, optional live console context, contextual R help,
    project course knowledge (lecture PDFs, notes, R examples and custom instructions),
    reviewed Source edits and explicitly approved script validation. Stores optional credentials
    in the operating system credential store, separately from package updates.
License: file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
Depends: R (>= 4.2.0)
Imports:
    askpass,
    callr,
    commonmark,
    ellmer (>= 0.5.0),
    htmltools,
    jsonlite,
    keyring (>= 1.3.0),
    knitr,
    later,
    remotes,
    rlang,
    rstudioapi,
    shiny (>= 1.14.0)
Suggests:
    pdftools
URL: https://github.com/MySimpleSmart/RAssistant
BugReports: https://github.com/MySimpleSmart/RAssistant/issues
Config/RAssistant/Changes: Disable Undo and Redo when the current Source has no available AI edit, without an unnecessary notification.
    Preview the current RStudio plot on the Plot button and on hover. Refresh when returning to the Viewer; click to attach a fresh full-size image.
    Read relevant Global Environment datasets automatically, or select and preview them beside Workspace. Send bounded current cell values with their real dimensions; Workspace Off disables both routes.
